            "review_title": "Review at Pho Cuong Phan",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nJust OK - But a Cheaper Option Off Of Giang Vo\nJan 2019 • Solo\nI had it in my head that I was going to have chicken pho - even though beef is a far more popular option. I've also been on a kick of exploring dining options off of the main drag of Giang Vo. This place was not bad. It was truly pretty average. But that's not necessarily a bad thing and I would absolutely return. I'd really wanted dark meat chicken but they'd already run out (by about 7:45am). But, the white meat wasn't bad and wasn't chewy like I've sometimes found. This is often the case because chicken pho means that the chicken meat has essentially been boiled twice. \n\nBut the staff was nice and the soup was nice and hot on a cold day.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 5, 2019",
